#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/mailnews/fetchmail.xml:97
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Create a dedicated user for the fetchmail program.  Issue the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Crie um(a) usuário(a) dedicado(a) para o aplicativo &quot;fetchmail&quot;. "
"Emita os seguintes comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/networking/mailnews/fetchmail.xml:102
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>useradd -c \"Fetchmail User\" -d /dev/null -g nogroup \\\n"
"        -s /bin/false -u 38 fetchmail</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>useradd -c \"Usuário(a) Fetchmail\" -d /dev/null -g nogroup \\\n"
"        -s /bin/false -u 38 fetchmail</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/networking/mailnews/fetchmail.xml:106
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Fetchmail</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Fetchmail</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

